Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:45:33 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 18/37] Preserve long address widths in printed assembly

Carry downstream 0044 above the native-width prerequisite and 0039.
Preserve symbolic and low-valued long operands through text round trips.
The native immediate printer is retained.

Original implementation: Claude Code 2.1.278, Claude Opus 5
(claude-opus-5), high reasoning effort; verified original session
65695418-7e9b-45bd-92e3-2ecfd88ecf0b. Earlier preparation and validation
credits remain in the 0044 packet at wbniv/llvm-mos-65816 c3a53aecbc48.

Rebase preparation: OpenAI Codex CLI 0.157.1 (session source vscode),
model gpt-6-astra, xhigh reasoning effort; verified session
01a0e67f-298f-7a21-80af-06f867085f84.
